WEBVTT

00:16.680 --> 00:20.280
Touku o miteru sono manazashi wa

00:20.280 --> 00:23.950
Kokoro no naka no koe o kiiteru

00:23.950 --> 00:28.120
Mada aoi tsuki o dakishimete

00:31.160 --> 00:34.830
Hashiri-tsuzukeru kimi no tsuyosa ga

00:34.830 --> 00:38.470
Mata atarashii tobira o hiraku

00:38.470 --> 00:42.670
Sugu akeru yoru o terashidase

00:45.670 --> 00:53.050
Tatoe hitori de mo kimi no
koto shinjite itai

00:53.050 --> 01:00.290
Sonna shunkan ni kono
sekai wa ugokidasu

01:00.290 --> 01:03.930
Nani o mitsukete yukou

01:03.930 --> 01:07.560
Kokoro o hakidashite

01:07.560 --> 01:14.300
Mata koko de aeru yo
sore ga shinjitsu nara

01:14.700 --> 01:18.410
Nani o mitsumete iyou

01:18.410 --> 01:25.210
Kono te o sashidashite
tsukanda genjitsu o

01:25.210 --> 01:28.880
Let it go shinjiyou

01:31.390 --> 01:34.450
In order to stop the experiments
to revive Gyumaoh,

01:34.860 --> 01:36.690
the Merciful Goddess sent

01:36.690 --> 01:42.100
Genjo Sanzo, Son Goku, Cho Hakkai,
and Sha Gojyo

01:42.100 --> 01:44.900
to India in the far west.

01:56.280 --> 01:58.050
Damn, this one's not cold.

01:58.050 --> 02:00.070
Goku, get me that beer over there.

02:00.480 --> 02:02.180
Get it yourself!

02:03.420 --> 02:07.990
What?! Is that any way to speak
to your elder?!

02:07.990 --> 02:10.490
Being over twenty doesn't make
you great or anything!

02:10.490 --> 02:11.660
What did you say?!

02:11.660 --> 02:14.900
Oh, how I envy you, you're so great!
Bravo! Well done!

02:14.900 --> 02:15.600
Hey!

02:15.600 --> 02:15.960
Hey!
Shuddup! Quit your sassy babbling!

02:15.960 --> 02:18.070
Shuddup! Quit your sassy babbling!

02:18.070 --> 02:20.300
Who's the one that won't
let up, baldy?!

02:20.670 --> 02:22.970
Damn it, don't you know how to
shut your mouths back there?!

02:22.970 --> 02:24.400
This isn't a field trip!

02:25.570 --> 02:27.170
Oh? It isn't?

02:28.010 --> 02:29.570
Well, I guess it's not much different.

02:31.580 --> 02:35.480
Now, now, the next town should be
coming into sight soon.

02:35.480 --> 02:38.210
Looks like we'll get to sleep with
a roof over our heads tonight.

02:40.020 --> 02:42.180
West and East.

02:42.990 --> 02:45.050
Each has begun to stir.

02:45.430 --> 02:47.400
To where the sun rises.

02:48.060 --> 02:50.190
And beyond where the sun sets.

02:51.930 --> 02:55.530
I have also received a report from the
Sanbutsushin, Merciful Goddess.

02:57.010 --> 02:59.800
So it has finally ended up happening.

03:00.980 --> 03:03.910
Everything was in motion long before.

03:03.910 --> 03:05.350
Lady?

03:05.350 --> 03:06.710
Five hundred years ago...

03:10.790 --> 03:12.450
Since that moment!

03:26.700 --> 03:29.270
Man, the food here is great!

03:29.270 --> 03:31.470
Let's see, what to eat next...

03:31.470 --> 03:34.870
Hey, you bastard, I was saving
that piece of fried chicken!

03:35.240 --> 03:36.540
Give it back!

03:36.540 --> 03:39.250
Oh, stuff it! Go eat grass
or something!

03:39.250 --> 03:41.220
How dare you, you third-rate,
pervy water sprite?!

03:41.220 --> 03:42.820
What'd you say, you stupid
dumb monkey?!

03:42.820 --> 03:44.680
Eat quietly! Quietly, damn it!

03:45.750 --> 03:47.720
Enough's enough, you knuckleheads!
What weird people.

03:47.720 --> 03:49.550
Really, thank you for the food.

03:49.930 --> 03:52.230
Did you make all of it yourself,
Miss Houmei?

03:52.230 --> 03:53.800
Yes...

03:53.800 --> 03:54.900
For real?!

03:54.900 --> 03:57.760
You're awesome! I haven't eaten
anything this good in a long time!

03:58.600 --> 03:59.730
Thank you.

04:01.640 --> 04:04.970
This is all I'm good at, so...

04:05.810 --> 04:10.110
By the way, what's the attitude
of the demons around here?

04:10.110 --> 04:12.110
There's nothing to say about them.

04:12.110 --> 04:13.450
Sure, just a while back,

04:13.450 --> 04:16.320
there were demons living
normally in this town too.

04:16.850 --> 04:20.060
But one day, they all just disappeared

04:20.060 --> 04:23.460
after killing ten or so
of the townspeople.

04:24.030 --> 04:27.320
So this disturbance has already
spread throughout Shangri-La.

04:27.960 --> 04:31.600
The berserk demons plant the
seeds of terror in humans,

04:31.600 --> 04:34.500
spurring on the destruction of balance.

04:34.500 --> 04:36.000
It's a vicious cycle.

04:36.000 --> 04:38.370
I wish all the demons would
just disappear!

04:39.410 --> 04:41.310
They kill people!

04:41.680 --> 04:45.240
They're nothing but monsters!

04:46.720 --> 04:47.880
Houmei!

04:55.420 --> 04:59.930
I'm sorry, one of the people who
was killed by the demons

04:59.930 --> 05:01.900
was a friend of hers.

05:04.300 --> 05:06.600
Considering what we just heard,

05:06.600 --> 05:11.570
it seems humans have become
very distrustful of demons.

05:11.570 --> 05:13.010
Pretty much.

05:13.010 --> 05:15.210
The commoners, who don't know
the reason for the disturbance,

05:15.210 --> 05:18.250
are sure to only see it as the demons
showing their true colors.

05:18.250 --> 05:21.950
Well, it's not like we can expect
them to understand.

05:21.950 --> 05:23.620
Gojyo's another matter,

05:23.620 --> 05:26.290
but Goku and I would not be
able to go about the city

05:26.290 --> 05:28.850
without these demon power limiters.

05:29.260 --> 05:32.320
Come to think of it, where'd
that Goku go?

05:32.730 --> 05:35.590
He's probably out raiding the
leftovers or something.

05:41.670 --> 05:43.530
Thank you. You're so helpful.

05:44.470 --> 05:46.960
Sanzo used to make me do
these things all the time.

05:47.840 --> 05:50.610
Ekitoku was good at splitting
firewood too.

05:50.610 --> 05:51.870
Ekitoku?

05:53.310 --> 05:55.910
We knew each other
since we were kids.

05:57.720 --> 05:59.910
But he was killed by a demon.

06:00.320 --> 06:04.450
No!

06:06.030 --> 06:08.300
It was impossible for
humans and demons

06:08.300 --> 06:10.390
to live together in the first place!

06:10.770 --> 06:12.490
Everyone in town says so too.

06:13.100 --> 06:15.130
You think so too, don't
you, Mr. Goku?!

06:16.000 --> 06:18.700
No, well, I...

06:22.980 --> 06:24.570
Demons are just...

06:25.350 --> 06:28.580
We'd be better off if they were
all dead! Isn't that right?!

06:35.090 --> 06:38.550
It would be best to keep quiet
about our identities.

06:39.260 --> 06:41.700
You don't want to start an unnecessary
commotion, do you?

06:41.700 --> 06:42.820
I know.

06:44.700 --> 06:46.430
They said they're a traveling troupe.

06:48.640 --> 06:50.340
A traveling troupe?

06:50.340 --> 06:52.770
Those dancer girls are pretty hot!

06:52.770 --> 06:55.270
Maybe I'll get them to dance
in my bed too.

06:55.980 --> 06:57.600
Instructional guidance!

07:05.020 --> 07:07.860
Anyway, where are we sleeping
tonight, Sanzo?

07:07.860 --> 07:09.560
That large group's staying here,

07:09.560 --> 07:11.920
but Houmei said they have
vacant singles.

07:13.230 --> 07:14.890
Well, let's see.

07:15.460 --> 07:19.330
We don't know when the demons
might launch a surprise attack,

07:19.330 --> 07:21.930
so it would be wisest to always
eat and sleep together.

07:22.440 --> 07:24.840
Despite all that, I see your mugs
often enough,

07:24.840 --> 07:26.840
and I don't want to have
to see them here too.

07:26.840 --> 07:28.210
Dismissed!

07:28.210 --> 07:29.780
How understanding of him.

07:29.780 --> 07:32.770
Goodness, everyone is so
honest with themselves.

07:33.280 --> 07:34.310
Goodnight.

07:39.190 --> 07:41.820
Lord Kougaiji, there is movement
in the East.

07:42.260 --> 07:45.230
I know. I won't let them interfere.

07:45.230 --> 07:47.830
I've already sent an assassin
after them.

07:47.830 --> 07:50.200
Lord Kougaiji, you are as swift as ever.

07:51.100 --> 07:54.230
Mother, this is all for you.

07:54.600 --> 07:57.160
In order to release you from
this binding spell,

07:58.070 --> 08:00.340
I would do anything!

08:16.060 --> 08:18.860
Houmei, you've done enough here.
Go get some sleep.

08:18.860 --> 08:20.730
Okay, but I'm almost done.

08:48.420 --> 08:49.450
Fool!

08:50.790 --> 08:52.360
Bastard, I'll kill...

08:52.360 --> 08:53.990
You'll kill who?

08:54.630 --> 08:57.270
Pointed ears, a birthmark
shaped like a symbol...

08:57.270 --> 08:58.830
A glimpse of those features

08:58.830 --> 09:02.170
tells me you are a creature other
than human, a demon.

09:02.600 --> 09:04.210
A banishing gun!

09:04.210 --> 09:08.580
And the fact you know this is a
banishing gun for killing demons

09:08.580 --> 09:11.840
means you're a little better than
the demons we've fought so far.

09:13.050 --> 09:14.750
I've got a question for you.

09:14.750 --> 09:16.480
Who's the one that violated
what was forbidden

09:16.480 --> 09:17.850
and gave rise to this chaos?

09:17.850 --> 09:19.580
Talk, I'll give you ten seconds!

09:19.950 --> 09:21.150
Too slow!

09:23.060 --> 09:25.530
It's only been two seconds!

09:26.430 --> 09:29.160
Shove it. Talk, now.

09:29.160 --> 09:33.230
Wait! I don't know who's
behind all this either!

09:33.230 --> 09:36.170
We're just following Lord
Kougaiji's orders!

09:36.170 --> 09:37.660
Kougaiji?!

09:39.240 --> 09:42.070
The only son of Gyumaoh
and Rasetsunyo.

09:42.680 --> 09:45.810
When Gyumaoh was put down
five hundred years ago,

09:45.810 --> 09:47.820
Kougaiji was supposed to
have been sealed away

09:47.820 --> 09:49.750
in Houtou Castle in India.

09:49.750 --> 09:52.590
Who broke the seal on Kougaiji?

09:52.590 --> 09:54.290
Whoever did it is most likely

09:54.290 --> 09:56.550
the one who is plotting
to revive Gyumaoh.

09:57.160 --> 09:59.750
Hey, you sure you got time
to hang around here?

10:01.660 --> 10:04.670
Assassins were sent to
the other rooms too.

10:04.670 --> 10:06.360
By now, your friends are probably...

10:07.140 --> 10:08.800
So what?

10:08.800 --> 10:10.170
Unfortunately for you,

10:10.170 --> 10:12.730
I'm not so considerate as to fear
for the safety of others.

10:19.210 --> 10:23.240
Exactly, you don't need to worry
about anyone else, right?

10:23.790 --> 10:26.280
Because you're going to die too.

10:28.260 --> 10:29.450
Houmei!

10:29.920 --> 10:32.360
I won't let you go any further west.

10:32.360 --> 10:34.830
Your journey will head towards
the nether world.

10:35.200 --> 10:38.960
Of course, all four of you,
happily together.

10:45.770 --> 10:46.440
Who's there?

10:46.440 --> 10:46.740
A member of the traveling troupe
that's staying here.
Who's there?

10:46.740 --> 10:49.140
A member of the traveling troupe
that's staying here.

10:49.140 --> 10:51.310
I couldn't sleep, so I
came over to play.

10:51.310 --> 10:52.710
Do you mind if I stick around?

10:53.410 --> 10:55.040
If you don't mind being in bed.

10:55.750 --> 10:57.680
What was that sound?

10:58.190 --> 11:02.820
Who cares? Come on. Let's have fun.

11:02.820 --> 11:04.160
Sure...

11:05.430 --> 11:09.360
But how about at least
trimming your nails?

11:14.540 --> 11:15.900
How did you know?!

11:16.370 --> 11:20.030
My data said you're easily distracted
by feminine charms.

11:20.610 --> 11:22.010
Sorry, but...

11:22.940 --> 11:25.670
I'm picky about my women.

11:26.210 --> 11:28.450
Goodness, what an ill-mannered person

11:28.450 --> 11:29.850
to attack me in my sleep.

11:30.590 --> 11:31.950
You okay, Hakkai?!

11:34.620 --> 11:36.660
So they came after you too.

11:36.660 --> 11:38.890
Never mind me, what about
Sanzo and Goku?

11:38.890 --> 11:40.690
Sanzo's in an annex,
Goku's next door.

11:43.200 --> 11:44.820
Are you all right, Goku?!

11:45.800 --> 11:48.740
What? Time for breakfast already?

11:49.270 --> 11:51.710
No, unfortunately...

11:51.710 --> 11:53.900
The little bastard did this in his sleep?

11:55.380 --> 11:59.680
None have ever escaped from the
webs of the Dark Spider Clan.

12:00.250 --> 12:02.750
Priest Genjo Sanzo...

12:02.750 --> 12:04.750
Warping space itself...

12:04.750 --> 12:07.550
An illusion created by black magic...
I was careless!

12:10.660 --> 12:13.460
You should stop your futile resistance.

12:13.460 --> 12:15.490
Don't you care what happens
to this girl?

12:16.100 --> 12:18.120
Don't or I'll kill you!

12:23.810 --> 12:27.300
Such fierce eyes. They're
wasted on a human.

12:27.880 --> 12:29.840
You know, I've heard that
if you consume

12:29.840 --> 12:32.510
a monk with high virtues,
you'll get to live longer.

12:32.510 --> 12:35.180
Do you think a monk with the
highest-ranking title of Sanzo

12:35.180 --> 12:38.310
would get me something
like eternal youth?

12:39.250 --> 12:43.660
Now that I look at you closely,
you've got a pretty face, boy.

12:44.660 --> 12:47.530
Up close, you've got wrinkles
everywhere, you damn hag!

12:48.260 --> 12:49.630
I've decided how I'll cook you now!

12:49.630 --> 12:50.930
I'll turn you into mincemeat!

12:50.930 --> 12:53.160
I'll tear you into such tiny pieces,
you won't be recognizable!

12:57.040 --> 13:01.340
You don't want to eat that monk.
He's smelly and tough to chew on.

13:01.340 --> 13:02.610
Boil him or fry him,

13:02.610 --> 13:04.310
he'll still be more than you
can bite off and chew.

13:07.950 --> 13:09.520
I'm not thanking you guys.

13:09.520 --> 13:13.010
Wasn't expecting you to, but you're
gonna pay her back, right?

13:14.090 --> 13:16.060
Of course!

13:16.060 --> 13:17.530
What kind of laid-back talk is that?!

13:17.530 --> 13:20.530
You can't touch me as long as
I have my hostage here!

13:20.530 --> 13:21.460
Then...

13:23.400 --> 13:25.130
We'll just have to take her back.

13:26.130 --> 13:29.530
So you see, we now have the
hostage safely in our care.

13:31.170 --> 13:33.470
Games should always be on
an even playing field.

13:35.910 --> 13:37.340
Kill them!

13:37.750 --> 13:38.810
You idiot!

13:38.810 --> 13:41.580
That's really low, taking hostage
a girl who's good at cooking!

13:42.520 --> 13:44.780
Nyoi-sansetsu-bou!

13:49.690 --> 13:51.180
Nice going.

13:55.860 --> 13:57.090
Can we do it?

13:57.530 --> 13:59.330
How tedious!

13:59.770 --> 14:03.200
Lethal Pest Extermination!

14:12.010 --> 14:13.780
Really! They're all such...

14:17.250 --> 14:19.320
Thanks for what you did back there.

14:19.320 --> 14:20.950
I charge really high interest!

14:21.490 --> 14:23.750
Don't underestimate me,
droopy-eyed boy!

14:29.430 --> 14:30.500
She can't be!

14:30.500 --> 14:31.860
Metamorphosis!

14:36.900 --> 14:39.710
Eww! Doesn't look tasty!

14:39.710 --> 14:42.300
I envy the way your brain must be
wired to think that way.

14:46.480 --> 14:48.280
I can't snap these!

14:48.280 --> 14:50.940
Her powers have increased because
of her transformation!

14:55.190 --> 14:57.260
Oh, we've woken you up.

14:57.260 --> 14:59.390
I'm sorry you had to get caught
in the middle of this.

15:00.190 --> 15:02.560
No!

15:06.800 --> 15:08.000
They snapped.

15:09.470 --> 15:10.840
Are you all right, Houmei?!

15:12.270 --> 15:13.300
Father...

15:13.710 --> 15:14.770
Father!

15:15.980 --> 15:17.410
I believe this is your gun?

15:18.050 --> 15:20.550
That's a ten percent finder's fee, then?

15:20.550 --> 15:21.710
Damn you!

15:22.780 --> 15:25.650
You're only a human!

15:29.920 --> 15:30.910
Houmei, don't look!

15:35.560 --> 15:38.030
Yuck! She's eating her friends!

15:39.770 --> 15:42.960
She is consuming their powers
to heal her wound.

15:46.310 --> 15:49.710
So, she eats men. She really
is a spider woman.

15:53.880 --> 15:55.510
I'll eat you too!

15:55.950 --> 15:57.010
Stop that!

15:57.390 --> 15:58.510
Mr. Goku!

16:00.520 --> 16:05.760
Why? Why do you protect the lowly
and powerless humans?!

16:05.760 --> 16:09.830
You boys are demons, just like us!

16:09.830 --> 16:11.170
What?

16:11.170 --> 16:13.730
No way, Mr. Goku's a demon?

16:14.440 --> 16:18.530
The enemy that attacked and killed
us humans? He can't be...

16:19.210 --> 16:20.470
She's lying, isn't she?!

16:22.840 --> 16:24.000
Liar!

16:24.710 --> 16:26.910
You were tricking me, all along...

16:27.580 --> 16:31.450
All this time! All this time!

16:31.450 --> 16:33.520
You were tricking me the whole time!

16:33.520 --> 16:34.960
No! I...

16:34.960 --> 16:37.190
Stay away from me, demon!

16:41.060 --> 16:41.890
Goku!

16:43.060 --> 16:44.260
Why, you!

16:50.400 --> 16:52.270
Longer, nyoi-bou!

16:59.550 --> 17:01.480
Why do you go to such lengths?!

17:01.480 --> 17:05.690
Why do you go so far to protect
the humans we demons detest?!

17:05.690 --> 17:06.980
Shuddup!

17:07.420 --> 17:11.950
Little things like whether we're humans
or demons don't matter!

17:12.890 --> 17:14.100
It's just that...

17:14.100 --> 17:16.860
Her cooking was good! That's all!

17:17.700 --> 17:19.000
Thank you.

17:20.000 --> 17:21.230
Mr. Goku...

17:23.200 --> 17:24.260
Let's do it!

17:25.310 --> 17:27.070
Hakkai, take care of Houmei
and her father.

17:27.510 --> 17:29.940
Gojyo, help Goku and
buy me some time.

17:30.340 --> 17:31.540
Got it!

17:32.580 --> 17:35.710
I will seal her mobility!

17:36.550 --> 17:38.450
Over here, spider woman!

17:39.890 --> 17:42.260
"Take women, but don't get
taken by them," right?

17:42.260 --> 17:43.920
Oh, wait, that's liquor.

17:47.760 --> 17:51.300
What in the world are you people?

17:51.300 --> 17:53.330
It's a long story,

17:53.330 --> 17:55.900
but there is a reason for the
demons going berserk.

17:55.900 --> 17:58.130
So, please never forget

17:58.770 --> 18:03.010
that the differences of our races are
nothing to come between us!

18:08.920 --> 18:11.510
Makai Tenjou!

18:15.790 --> 18:17.880
Go beat the crap out of her, Goku!

18:18.490 --> 18:19.690
All right!

18:20.730 --> 18:22.200
Go!

18:22.600 --> 18:25.260
Nyoi-bou!

18:41.650 --> 18:43.350
Leaving already?

18:43.350 --> 18:44.510
Yes...

18:44.990 --> 18:47.560
We can't afford to stay long.

18:47.560 --> 18:49.850
Guess Houmei isn't going
to see us off.

18:50.790 --> 18:53.520
It can't be helped, not after what
happened yesterday.

18:53.930 --> 18:55.360
Liar!

18:55.360 --> 18:57.630
You were tricking me all along!

18:57.630 --> 18:58.830
You were tricking me!

18:58.830 --> 18:59.990
You were tricking me!

19:00.330 --> 19:02.040
Well, we should get going.

19:02.040 --> 19:03.160
Please wait!

19:10.340 --> 19:11.850
Houmei!

19:11.850 --> 19:14.970
This is all I can do.

19:15.650 --> 19:18.170
So I packed you a lunch.

19:19.150 --> 19:23.110
If it's all right, I hope you will all...

19:23.490 --> 19:24.510
Sure!

19:25.930 --> 19:27.090
Thank you!

19:33.430 --> 19:38.900
I have to apologize to them!
I said such terrible things!

19:39.910 --> 19:43.480
Houmei, you packed it all into
that lunch, didn't you?

19:43.480 --> 19:46.750
Your "thank you" and "I'm sorry".

19:46.750 --> 19:51.120
Little things like whether we're humans
or demons don't matter!

19:51.120 --> 19:53.920
It's just that her cooking was good!
That's all!

20:00.190 --> 20:03.220
Don't worry, they understand.

20:06.700 --> 20:09.800
They finally sent an assassin
directly after us.

20:09.800 --> 20:12.510
Gyumaoh's revival, this person
called Kougaiji...

20:12.510 --> 20:12.670
Hey, this stewed meat with
ginger is really good!

20:12.670 --> 20:14.380
Hey, this stewed meat with
ginger is really good!
There is too much that is
still a mystery,

20:14.380 --> 20:14.710
Hey, this stewed meat with
ginger is really good!
But it seems the situation is more
serious than we thought.

20:14.710 --> 20:16.710
Oh, shut up already,
you stupid monkey!
But it seems the situation is more
