20:18.080 --> 20:19.350
Hey, Gojyo, leave some for me too!
Yeah, but before that,

20:19.350 --> 20:22.210
can't we do something about
the idiots in the back?!

20:23.020 --> 20:24.080
My sentiments exactly.

20:25.290 --> 20:27.120
Damn it, I'm confiscating this!

20:27.120 --> 20:28.760
Hey, my Napolitan!

20:28.760 --> 20:30.560
Oh, hand it over!

20:30.560 --> 20:32.390
Hey, but you're eating it too, Sanzo!

20:39.930 --> 20:46.000
Sou hito ga yosasou na
kao de yatte kuru

20:46.370 --> 20:51.500
Totsuzen na higeki mo
utagau koto wa naku

20:51.950 --> 20:57.180
Nagekigoto sezu damatta mama de

20:57.180 --> 21:00.520
Ue o miagerunda

21:00.520 --> 21:06.530
Donna arifureta shiin
mo enji-tsuzukeru

21:06.530 --> 21:11.870
Yume toka kibou toka iu mae ni sa

21:11.870 --> 21:17.300
Kitto dare ni totte mo onaji koto darou

21:17.300 --> 21:21.260
You must fight against yourself

21:28.180 --> 21:31.820
The sun sets and a new day comes

21:31.820 --> 21:34.020
Repeating is one change

21:34.020 --> 21:38.060
Don't avert eyes from differences

21:38.060 --> 21:42.000
Your nerve and soul to the limit

21:42.000 --> 21:44.830
Go forward now

21:44.830 --> 21:49.800
Haritsumeta puresshaa tonariawase de

21:49.800 --> 21:55.240
Dare yori mo daitan futeki ni warau

21:55.240 --> 22:00.710
